{"3085280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Great Fluctus", "steam_appid": 3085280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to dive into the most absurd, unpredictable universe you've ever seen with The Great Fluctus! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Great Fluctus</strong> is a colony-building sandbox with survival elements, set in a voxel-based alien world with a truly unique visual style. Players mine resources, shape the terrain, and transform a small space base into a lively alien town. Build, farm, trade, and manage your evolving community while using diplomacy to attract new inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever you need a break from colony life, explore the nearby alien civilization. Trade with locals, take on quests, or even join the sacred race to deliver a baby shrimpling. The world is full of surprises, where quirky characters, humorous dialogues, and unpredictable events add depth and charm. Every encounter weaves into a lighthearted storyline, blending exploration, creativity, and strategy in this dynamic sandbox experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085280/extras/d39a8847505620f34fbf761cac5fc953.poster.avif?t=1786977278\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085280/extras/d39a8847505620f34fbf761cac5fc953.webm?t=1786977278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085280/extras/d39a8847505620f34fbf761cac5fc953.mp4?t=1786977278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto